---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Meet the Builder — Juan Manuel Obrach">
  <main class="maker-page">
    <section class="maker-hero">
      <div class="maker-avatar">
        <div class="avatar-circle">JO</div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="maker-title">Hi, I'm Juan Manuel Obrach.</h1>
      <p class="maker-subtitle">The architect behind Entity Builders.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="maker-content">
      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>The Vibe Coding Journey</h2>
        <p>
          I started Entity Builders with a simple philosophy: build fast, validate quickly, and create tools that solve real problems. As a solo-preneur, I believe in "Vibe Coding"—prioritizing momentum and code reuse to create an interconnected universe of micro-SaaS products.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every app in the Entity Builders ecosystem shares the same core logic and infrastructure, allowing me to ship faster and maintain high quality across the board.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>The Solo-Stack</h2>
        <ul class="tech-stack">
          <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> React Native (Expo) & Astro</li>
          <li><strong>Backend:</strong> Supabase (Auth, Postgres, Realtime)</li>
          <li><strong>Payments:</strong> Stripe</li>
          <li><strong>AI:</strong> Gemini & LangChain</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
        <p>I'm always open to chat about tech, micro-SaaS, or new ideas.</p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/juanobrach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Footer />
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .maker-page {
    padding-top: 4rem;
  }
  
  .maker-hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .avatar-circle {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gradient-hero, linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #a855f7));
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
  }

  .maker-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .maker-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .maker-content {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem 4rem;
  }

  .content-block {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .content-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .content-block p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tech-stack {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tech-stack li {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .tech-stack strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .social-links {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background: var(--surface-3);
    border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
  }
</style>
